(vector (map (:adr/consequences (vector "kotoba-lang keeps the CLJ/EDN rewrite without rollback" "@com-junkawasaki/office-causal and @com-junkawasaki/svgraph package identity remains available for SVG-era tooling" "ADR-2606302300 remains the default org taxonomy, with this explicit exception for legacy SVG-era Office tooling" "west can check out both lines of development at once for comparison and porting" "Full west regeneration must follow ADR-2606272237 pin-regression guardrails")), (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "office-causal / svgraph の GitHub org と west path の例外扱い" "kotoba-lang の CLJ/EDN 版と com-junkawasaki の SVG-era 版を別 repo として共存させる方針" "manifest/repos.edn の path-overrides から office-causal / svgraph を外す理由")), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "org-taxonomy"), (:adr/related (vector "90-docs/adr/2606302300-org-taxonomy-4-orgs.edn" "90-docs/adr/2606271500-west-manifest-over-vcstool.edn" "90-docs/adr/2606272237-west-manifest-api-single-entry.edn" "manifest/repos.edn" "manifest/west.yml")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607011100-svg-era-office-repo-split"), (:adr/context "{:moved-to-kotoba {\"orgs/kotoba-lang/office\" \"CLJC OOXML reader / EDN graph / ocz/causal.edn\", \"orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph\" \"CLJ/nbb svgraph\", \"orgs/kotoba-lang/svg\" \"SVG-first SVGraph / DrawingML / PPTX converter\"}, :problem \"CLJ/EDN 版と SVG-era TypeScript/browser/JSONL 版を同じ repo 名・west path に押し込むと package identity, GitHub Pages, SVG Office integration の意味が混ざる。\"}"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-01"), (:adr/body "\n# ADR-2607011100: SVG-era office-causal/svgraph を com-junkawasaki に復元し、kotoba-lang CLJ/EDN 版と west で並走させる\n\n**Status**: accepted  \n**Date**: 2026-07-01  \n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\n`office-causal` と `svgraph` は一度 `com-junkawasaki` から `kotoba-lang`\nへ移され、CLJ/CLJC/EDN 寄りのライブラリとして再編された。\n\n- `orgs/kotoba-lang/office`: CLJC OOXML reader / EDN graph / `ocz/causal.edn`\n- `orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph`: CLJ/nbb 寄りの `svgraph`\n- `orgs/kotoba-lang/svg`: SVG-first SVGraph / DrawingML / PPTX converter\n\nこの移管は ADR-2606302300 の「library/substrate は `kotoba-lang`」に沿う。\n一方で、旧 `com-junkawasaki/office-causal` と旧 `com-junkawasaki/svgraph`\nには、SVG / TypeScript / browser / JSONL / DrawingML 前提の実装と公開面が残っていた。\nCLJ/EDN 版と SVG 版を同じ repo 名・同じ west path に押し込むと、利用者・package 名・\nGitHub Pages・Office SVG 連携の意味が混ざる。\n\n## Decision\n\n`kotoba-lang` 側はそのまま canonical CLJ/EDN 版として残す。あわせて、\nSVG-era の旧版を `com-junkawasaki` に独立 repo として復元する。\n\n| concern | repo | west path | role |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| CLJC / EDN Office graph | `kotoba-lang/office` | `orgs/kotoba-lang/office` | kotoba language substrate |\n| CLJ/nbb svgraph | `kotoba-lang/svgraph` | `orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph` | kotoba language substrate |\n| SVG-first SVGraph / DrawingML / PPTX converter | `com-junkawasaki/svgraph` | `orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph` | SVG-era browser/Office tooling |\n| TypeScript Office causal graph / JSONL / SVG overlay | `com-junkawasaki/office-causal` | `orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal` | SVG-era Office causal tooling |\n\nManifest policy:\n\n- remove `orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal -> orgs/kotoba-lang/office`\n  from `manifest/repos.edn :path-overrides`\n- remove `orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph -> orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph`\n  from `manifest/repos.edn :path-overrides`\n- add both restored paths to `manifest/repos.edn :extra-projects`\n- record both restored projects in `manifest/west.yml`\n\nConcrete pins restored on 2026-07-01:\n\n- `orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal`:\n  `374acbce9bb5a3bac3a0c3172f436e07bcfbb8c6`\n- `orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph`:\n  `f4e17a8d448a7cf2e2fa802ad9268b59afa56192`\n\nBoth GitHub repos are public and use `main`:\n\n- <https://github.com/com-junkawasaki/office-causal>\n- <https://github.com/com-junkawasaki/svgraph>\n\n## Consequences\n\n- `kotoba-lang` keeps the CLJ/EDN rewrite without rollback.\n- SVG/browser/TypeScript package identity is preserved under\n  `@com-junkawasaki/office-causal` and `@com-junkawasaki/svgraph`.\n- ADR-2606302300 remains the default taxonomy, but this ADR is the explicit\n  exception: these two `com-junkawasaki` repos are retained because they are\n  legacy SVG-era product/tooling surfaces, not the canonical kotoba CLJ/EDN\n  substrate.\n- `west list` can show both lines of development at once, so migration work can\n  compare or port behavior without renaming directories by hand.\n- `manifest/west.yml` was updated with a minimal two-entry patch. Full\n  regeneration must still follow the pin-regression warning in\n  ADR-2606272237: align child repo HEADs before running\n  `nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs`, otherwise unrelated checked-out repos may\n  move their pins.\n\n## Verification\n\nRun on 2026-07-01:\n\n- `npm run check` in `orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal`\n- `npm run check:web` in `orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph`\n- `python3 -m pytest tests/test_migration.py -q` in\n  `orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph` (`54 passed`)\n\n## References\n\n- `manifest/repos.edn`\n- `manifest/west.yml`\n- ADR-2606302300: four-org taxonomy\n- ADR-2606271500: west manifest over submodules/vcstool\n- ADR-2606272237: west manifest single-entry workflow and pin-regression trap"), (:adr/decision "{:summary \"kotoba-lang 側は canonical CLJ/EDN 版として残し、SVG-era の旧 office-causal / svgraph を com-junkawasaki に独立 repo として復元する。\", :projects {\"orgs/kotoba-lang/office\" {:repo \"kotoba-lang/office\", :role :kotoba-cljc-edn-office-graph, :west-path \"orgs/kotoba-lang/office\"}, \"orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph\" {:repo \"kotoba-lang/svgraph\", :role :kotoba-clj-nbb-svgraph, :west-path \"orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph\"}, \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal\" {:repo \"com-junkawasaki/office-causal\", :role :svg-era-office-causal-tooling, :west-path \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal\", :revision \"374acbce9bb5a3bac3a0c3172f436e07bcfbb8c6\", :url \"https://github.com/com-junkawasaki/office-causal\"}, \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\" {:repo \"com-junkawasaki/svgraph\", :role :svg-era-svgraph-browser-office-tooling, :west-path \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\", :revision \"f4e17a8d448a7cf2e2fa802ad9268b59afa56192\", :url \"https://github.com/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\"}}, :manifest-change {:remove-path-overrides [\"orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal -> orgs/kotoba-lang/office\" \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph -> orgs/kotoba-lang/svgraph\"], :add-extra-projects [\"orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal\" \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\"], :west-yml \"minimal two-entry patch; avoid unrelated pin movement unless child HEADs are aligned before regeneration\"}}"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/verification "[{:path \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/office-causal\", :command \"npm run check\", :result :pass} {:path \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\", :command \"npm run check:web\", :result :pass} {:path \"orgs/com-junkawasaki/svgraph\", :command \"python3 -m pytest tests/test_migration.py -q\", :result \"54 passed\"}]"), (:adr/title "ADR-2607011100: SVG-era office-causal/svgraph を com-junkawasaki に復元し、kotoba-lang CLJ/EDN 版と west で並走させる"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))